WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
 Marvel fans, I am
joined by Xochitl Gomez.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.690
How's it going?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.810
 I'm doing great.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:05.610
I'm nervous.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.880
I'm excited.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.670
INTERVIEWER: What are you
looking forward to seeing

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.410
most in this film tonight?

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.780
 Well, number one,
my homies, Benedict

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:14.400
Cumberbatch and Benny Wong.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.379
Gotta support the crew.

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:20.520
I'm really excited to see
just this movie in general.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.650
 Have you been a Spider-Man
fan for a long time?

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.060
 Oh yeah.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.660
I'm like-- who hasn't been
since like five years old?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.590
I mean, are you kidding me?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.990
[LAUGHING]

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.990
INTERVIEWER: That makes sense.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.790
You're-- you're right.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.200
So there's quite a bit of
crossover between the cast

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.690
and the cast in
your upcoming film,

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.720
Marvel Studios' Doctor Strange
in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.150
What is it like
working with Benedict

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.680
Cumberbatch and Benedict Wong?

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.750
 Oh, I mean, it's
pretty insane.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.940
I'm a pretty lucky person.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:48.770
It's pretty crazy.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.570
I just love watching them get in
their character and their zone.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.840
And it's just been wonderful,
like, teaching experience,

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.340
honestly.

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.920
It's just crazy to be like, oh
my gosh, I know these people.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.580
It's kind of funny.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.380
 I bet.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:05.740
Who are you excited to see most
on this red carpet tonight?

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.160
 Zendaya.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:07.960
Zendaya.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.040
 Girl, yes.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:09.850
 I'm excited.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:13.360
I'm like-- I'm like,
is she here now?

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.500
 I'm waiting for the scream.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.240
 I know.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.040
There.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.900
I hear some screams.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:20.847
Could be her.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:21.780
 So I heard you skateboard.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.580
Is that true?

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.690
 Yes, I do a little
bit of skateboarding.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:27.360
But ever since I started getting
some, like, roles I was like,

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.260
I can't really
injure myself here.

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.260
So I just--

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:32.127
I just graze a little bit.

00:01:32.127 --> 00:01:32.927
 Yeah, yeah.

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:33.727
No crazy trick.

00:01:33.727 --> 00:01:34.527
 No, no, no.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:35.400
No.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.560
I might be able to have,
like, some fake blood

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.930
and stuff for work, but
not nothing in real life.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:41.730
Nuh uh.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:42.960
 That's a cool skill to have.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.820
And you just celebrated
your quinceanera?

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:45.780
 Yes, I did.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.420
It was during COVID and
stuff, so I couldn't really

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.460
have some, like, huge
thing, which, I mean,

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.840
I really wish I could have.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.900
But I just went around the
park and around just LA

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.990
and just took some photos.

